  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower 2,000 more Venezuelan Children to Succeed!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The excellent results achieved by 4,000 students of a very troubled area of central Venezuela with the &apos;Alive to the World&apos; character and life skills program last year, allow us to extend the program to 2,000 new students! ** Los excelentes resultados obtenidos con el programa de formacion de caracter y destrezas para la vida &apos;Aprendiendo a Querer&apos; entre 4,000 alumnos de una zona muy conflictiva del centro de Venezuela, nos inspiran y obligan a extenderlo a 2,000 alumnos mas!</narrative>
  </description>
